# Feature-sized commits (portfolio)

Global policy lives at `~/.cursor/rules/feature-sized-commits.mdc` (also Cursor User Rules, `~/.codex/AGENTS.md`, `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`). Do not fork a second full copy here.

## Dev server (portfolio only)

If Vite is down on this project, restart:

```bash
npm run dev -- --port 9999 --host 127.0.0.1 --strictPort
```
